# JavaByteCodeMachine — .gitignore
# NOTE: a "#" only starts a comment at the START of a line. Inline comments after
# a pattern (e.g. "logs/   # ...") do NOT work — git treats the whole thing as the
# pattern. Keep every comment on its own line.

# --- Transient / generated at runtime (safe to delete; recreated on next run) ---
logs/
.classes/
target/

# --- Default export / save filenames ---
trace.txt
trace.html
disasm.txt

# --- hsdis disassembler plugins ---
# Fetched + verified on first run by scripts/disasm.sh. Kept out of git: large,
# arch-specific, GPL (OpenJDK-derived) binaries. See README "Fetched for you on first run".
tools/hsdis/*.so

# --- Compiled Java (we ship source only) ---
*.class

# --- Claude Code local settings (personal; shared .claude/settings.json may be committed) ---
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- OS / editor / IDE cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
